        1230,
        1491,
        1401
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, to achieve this goal, it is necessary to establish a unified program focused on increasing voter participation and civic engagement in New York City, encourage every eligible New Yorker to make their voice heard at the ballot box, and work to address and eliminate historic barriers to voting through public education, outreach, and policy reform efforts; and",
